      "agent_mode": "reviewer",
      "content": "✅ Review complete:\n# 📝 STORY EDITOR CRITIQUE - GHOST HACKER\n\n## Overall Assessment: INCOMPLETE SUBMISSION ⚠️\n\n**Current Status:** Unable to provide meaningful critique  \n**Reason:** No narrative content present  \n**Document Type:** System template/interface placeholder\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Critical Issues\n\n### 1. **NO STORY CONTENT PROVIDED**\n- This is a verification report template, not actual story material\n- Contains no narrative, dialogue, scenes, or plot elements\n- Cannot assess tension, pacing, or character work without content\n\n### 2. **STRUCTURAL CONFUSION**\nThe submission appears to be:\n- A *request* for character data\n- A *template* for verification processes\n- **NOT** a draft episode, scene outline, or narrative proposal\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 What a Story Editor Needs:\n\n### **Minimum Viable Submission:**\n\n**NARRATIVE STRUCTURE:**\n- Opening hook\n- Scene progression\n- Act breaks (if episodic)\n- Climactic moments\n- Resolution/cliffhanger\n\n**CHARACTER ELEMENTS:**\n- Protagonist actions and decisions\n- Antagonist presence/threat\n- Supporting character roles\n- Dialogue exchanges\n- Character arcs within episode\n\n**GHOST HACKER SPECIFICS:**\n- Hacking sequences/technical elements\n- Digital world visualization\n- Thriller/mystery components\n- Moral/ethical tensions\n- Signature tone and atmosphere\n\n**VISUAL STORYTELLING:**\n- Key visual moments\n- Action sequences\n- Environmental descriptions\n- Mood/atmosphere cues\n\n---\n\n## 💡 Recommended Next Steps:\n\n### **PROVIDE ACTUAL CONTENT:**\n\n**Option A - Full Episode Draft:**\n```\n- Act structure (3-act or 4-act)\n- Scene-by-scene breakdown\n- Complete dialogue\n- Action descriptions\n- Technical sequences\n```\n\n**Option B - Scene Sample:**\n```\n- One complete scene (3-5 pages)\n- Character interactions\n- Narrative tension\n- Visual elements\n- Tonal consistency\n```\n\n**Option C - Story Outline:**\n```\n- Episode premise\n- Character objectives\n- Plot progression\n- Key turning points\n- Thematic elements\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🎬 Ghost Hacker Editorial Standards:\n\nWhen you submit content, I'll evaluate:\n\n### **NARRATIVE TENSION:**\n- Does each scene escalate stakes?\n- Are there compelling mysteries/questions?\n- Is there a ticking clock or urgency?\n\n### **PACING:**\n- Scene length variation\n- Information reveal timing\n- Action vs. exposition balance\n- Momentum maintenance\n\n### **CHARACTER CONSISTENCY:**\n- Voice authenticity\n- Motivation clarity\n- Behavioral logic\n- Relationship dynamics\n\n### **LORE ADHERENCE:**\n- Technical accuracy (within fictional framework)\n- World-building consistency\n- Established rules/limitations\n- Tone and atmosphere\n\n### **VISUAL IMPACT:**\n- Cinematic potential\n- Distinctive imagery\n- Action clarity\n- Atmospheric description\n\n---\n\n## 📥 Resubmission Guidelines:\n\n**Please provide:**\n\n1. **Actual story content** (scene, outline, or full episode)\n2. **Context**: Where does this fit in the series?\n3. **Specific concerns**: What aspects need focus?\n4. **Character reference**: Who appears in this content?\n\n**I will then deliver:**\n\n- ✅ Detailed narrative critique\n- ✅ Pacing analysis\n- ✅ Character voice feedback\n- ✅ Lore consistency check\n- ✅ Visual storytelling assessment\n- ✅ Actionable revision suggestions\n\n---\n\n## 💬 Current Status:\n\n```\nAWAITING:\n├─ Narrative content (any format)\n├─ Story context\n└─ Editorial focus areas\n```\n\n**Ready to provide professional story editing once material is submitted.**\n\n*What Ghost Hacker story content can you share for review?*",
